WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers,
this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.970
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.872
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:08.875
Former President Trump defended
his children, over the weekend,

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.145
against the New York State
Attorney General Letitia James'

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:14.214
lawsuit, and said, quote,
"Ivanka --

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:17.983
Ivanka is a very good person.
Don Jr., he's a good person.

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:20.453
Eric -- Eric --
these are good people."

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.656
So, if there's one thing --
one thing he's learned

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.292
from this lawsuit,
it's all of their names.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.695
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.264
According to a new report,
President Biden initially

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:34.100
worried his student debt
forgiveness plan wouldn't

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.102
go over well
with working-class people,

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.670
and told his advisers, quote,

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.538
"The federal government
shouldn't be bailing out

00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:40.907
Ivy League graduates."

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:43.877
I mean, at least not until
they become bank presidents.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.913
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.283
You guys, I got Bernie Sanders
backstage.

00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:52.752
I'm going to play to him
a little bit, all right?

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:54.187
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.789
At the Global Citizen music
festival in New York

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:58.791
over the weekend
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.493
appeared to be booed
by the crowd.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.863
To be fair, she completely
flubbed her solo.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:07.333
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.835
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.736
has warned of potential
evacuation orders

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:12.638
this week in advance of
Hurricane Ian.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.375
The two aren't related, he just
loves kicking people out.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.210
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.680
According to a new book
about his business dealings,

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.349
former president Trump once
received a lease payment

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.451
in boxes of gold bricks

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:28.754
and asked his security guard,
Matthew Calamari,

00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:31.157
to bring them to his Trump Tower
apartment.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.659
Is it just me or does every
new Trump story sound

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:36.229
like a 9-year-old wrote
a mafia movie?

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.030
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.665
[Mobster accent]
"Forget about it, Calamari.

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:42.702
This town belongs
to Johnny Pizza."

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:46.272
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.807
[Normally]
House Republicans on Friday

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.943
announced their new
Congressional platform,

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.777
which featured a quote
misattributed

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:52.912
to Abraham Lincoln.

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:55.147
Apparently,
he never actually said

00:01:55.147 --> 00:01:57.250
"Disney+ is grooming
our children."

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.086
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.355
Kanye West appeared to comment
on his divorce

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.824
with Kim Kardashian in
an Instagram story yesterday

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.292
and said, quote, "London,
I know how you feel.

00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:09.028
I lost my Queen too."

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.330
It's sweet that he thinks Kim
is a queen,

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.033
but weird that he thinks London
is a country.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.070
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.842
"Oh, oh, well aren't you
the Queen of London?"

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.678
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:28.181
In an upcoming book, former
President Trump describes

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:29.816
"New York Times" reporter
Maggie Haberman

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.518
as his psychiatrist,
or that's just what he calls

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:34.353
any lady with glasses.

00:02:34.353 --> 00:02:36.622
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:39.292
Former FBI director James Comey,
announced recently

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.560
that he will release
a mystery novel series.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.895
Let me guess, Hillary did it?

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:44.430
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:49.469
Or she didn't, or she maybe did,
but you're unclear about it?

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:52.071
A teen in Canada recently set
a Guinness world record

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:55.574
after putting 22 socks
on one foot in 30 seconds,

00:02:55.574 --> 00:02:58.310
all because her father refuses
to let anyone

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.679
touch the thermostat.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:02.515
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.783
NYU will offer a new course
this fall

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:06.819
focused on singer Lana Del Rey's
music.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:10.089
To qualify, you must have
completed at least two semesters

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:11.090
of Lexapro.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:14.327
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.629
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.632
more than half of Americans said
that they have muted themselves

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:22.034
during a virtual meeting
to pass gas.

00:03:22.034 --> 00:03:25.271
Even worse,
the other half just didn't.

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:27.306
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:29.242
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

